WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:03.190
You can't even do this?!

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.440
Mazuru could do it in one try!

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:07.720
Mazuru could do it more beautifully!

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.150
Mazuru could...

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.650
Hey, Luou! Let's go!

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:16.090
Yo.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.160
Huh? What?!

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.100
I heard from Miyako.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.790
She said not to go to Oikawa.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:27.100
What? But it's to get the students 
to come back here...

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.590
That's...

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.670
not something you need to worry about.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:36.220
Well, there's only five days left. Then...

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>It'll all be back to the way it was.</i>

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:14.480
Act 8: "Oh, I Wanna Do It Again!!"

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:18.610
<b>Fourth Day of Summer School</b>

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:18.630
You're going to join the SS class, right?

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:23.040
No, I'm not!

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:25.370
I didn't know we were aiming 
for the same thing, though.

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:26.950
Mariinsky!

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:30.210
Or Bolshoi's danseur noble...

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:32.520
I told you not to talk about it.

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:34.230
What about you?

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:37.210
Saying crap like your body's not meant 
for ballet, or that you have no talent...

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:39.460
It looks like the opposite to me.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:43.600
Even if those ten-plus years 
of ballet were forced on you,

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:45.720
the result is who you are now, right?

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:48.510
I'm jealous of that.

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:54.060
Okay, break over!

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:56.260
In the second half of class,

00:02:56.260 --> 00:03:01.320
we'll practice pas de deux with 
the 13-to-15-year-old girls SS class.

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:03.530
Crap, I'm so sweaty.

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.640
Dancing with girls on that
 level is a lot of pressure...

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:07.340
Y-Yamato-senpai...

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:08.200
What is it?

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:11.330
I've been wondering for a while...

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:15.070
Nipples?

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:18.510
I've been seeing them since 
I was little, so I'm used to them.

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:19.950
I'm not!

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:23.610
Well, you have to be able to see all the 
fine muscle movements during practice,

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:26.190
and when wearing thin costumes, 
underwear lines can distract

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:28.850
from the presentation and 
break the audience's immersion.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:32.660
No, this confusion can't 
be explained by art...

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:34.670
It's all right, Jumpei.

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:36.460
When they put on uniforms or casual clothes

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:39.120
and let down their hair to go
 home, it'll affect ya more.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:42.400
Ah, just what I'd expect from 
Playboy-in-Disguise-senpai.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:44.620
I wanna reach that state of mind, too!

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:47.420
Will ya stop callin' me that?

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:55.120
Oh, it's the girl who clapped 
for ya at the match yesterday.

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:57.510
She must like ya.

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:59.500
Nope. She doesn't.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:00.880
Really?

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:05.050
<i>Because Miyako likes this guy.</i>

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.070
Jumpei.

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:10.360
I hope we can be partners.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.190
Yeah...

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:16.610
Huh? Why?

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:19.070
You want to dance with him?

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:19.820
Huh?

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:24.860
I mean, up until recently, I was practicing 
pas de deux with Jumpei every day.

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:26.160
And it was fun!

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.230
<i>I had fun, too, Miyako!</i>

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:29.680
What are you saying, Miyako?

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:31.120
You should partner with me.

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:34.030
Didn't you say that you'd be my princess

00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:36.080
and protect me forever?

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:39.120
<i>How can he say that so easily?!</i>

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:43.970
Oh, you remembered that, Luou?

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:47.720
<i>What is this "childhood 
friends' first love" vibe?!</i>

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:49.240
Hey, you three!

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:52.150
The teachers will decide your partners.

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:55.480
Though I suppose height-wise,
 you two will work.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.740
What a handsome couple!

00:04:57.740 --> 00:05:01.110
<i>Wait, so your feelings were reciprocated?!</i>

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:03.780
And you...

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:05.190
Let's pair you with Natsuki.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:09.950
<i>Oh, it's the girl who clapped for me.</i>

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.240
Thanks for yesterday.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:14.300
I'm Murao Jumpei. 
Second-year in junior high.

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:16.680
I'm Natsuki. Sixth grade.

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:17.460
Nice to meet you.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.800
Sixth grade?! Like, elementary school?!

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.110
What the heck?

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:24.860
Hey, are you making fun of me?!

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:25.720
No, no, no.

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:31.140
I'm not gonna match your movements 
the way Miyako-chan does.

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:34.790
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:36.430
Hey, Jumpei-kun!

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:37.900
What is it?

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:41.680
I thought I'd heard the name "Natsuki" before.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:43.740
She's the only person in
 Oikawa to skip levels.

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:45.400
It's best not to argue with her.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:49.450
I mean, she's Oikawa Ayako-san's daughter!

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:51.440
What?!

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:55.120
Okay, take the girl to one side.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:59.390
Those who aren't used to it can
 stay at ten or fifteen degrees.

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:03.750
Boys, support the girls with your whole arms.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.690
You can go farther than that, can't you?

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:08.300
I know you danced a 
pas de deux with Miyako-chan.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.970
Huh? Did you watch that?

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:16.690
What did you mean by Miyako 
matching my movements?

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:20.440
During that <i>Swan Lake</i> pas de deux, 
you were getting all the attention,

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.900
and no one was looking at Miyako-chan.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:29.030
In a pas de deux, the male dancer 
should make the female dancer look good.

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:33.030
Even though she was the main 
character, I felt bad for her!

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:36.340
Oh, that's so pretty!

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:42.160
Very good. Can you bend more?

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:48.000
Open your arms, and keep your 
center perfectly straight.

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:54.100
That's it.

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.980
They're so together!

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:57.030
They're cousins, right?

00:06:57.030 --> 00:06:59.130
Even so, it's like...

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:01.850
Don't you think Miyako 
looks prettier than usual?

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.360
<i>She does!</i>

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:06.560
<i>It's like her... shape? Silhouette?</i>

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:09.720
<i>You're left seeing only the beautiful lines.</i>

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:13.940
<i>He's holding Miyako still for a 
moment at her best position?</i>

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:20.540
<i>Back then, I just wanted
to show how happy I was.</i>

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:24.160
<i>To show Miyako at her best...</i>

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:27.680
<i>I didn't think about that one bit.</i>

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:30.900
Okay, don't just watch them.

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:33.510
The rest of you give it a try, too.

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:34.640
Hey.

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:36.640
Let's try that.

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:38.340
Ready?

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:39.150
Huh?!

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:43.710
<i>So light!</i>

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:44.670
Oh?

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:47.380
Natsuki, don't try to stand on your own.

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:50.940
Let your partner's weight support you 
and pull your own body up.

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:55.370
Ow...

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:58.340
Good on you for protecting the girl!

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:02.130
This is the first time I've ever 
seen Natsuki-chan fall.

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:06.090
Are you okay?

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:11.010
The boy has to hold the girl up, 
no matter what happens!

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:12.480
Ugh!

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:16.150
I don't wanna have to pay attention to 
what this monkey's doing while I dance!

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:22.020
Why's the damn elementary
 schooler freaking out on me?!

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:24.020
Boys' Changing Room

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:25.770
Nipples!

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:28.680
You were right. I didn't think 
about them at all.

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:31.530
Jumpei, you look exhausted.

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:35.690
We have pas de deux with the 
same partners again tomorrow.

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:39.760
The SS class those girls are in 
should be over soon, too.

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:43.160
I was gonna go get my
 partner's LIME username.

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:44.280
You guys come, too.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:47.920
Partnership is important, right?

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:50.700
Just what I'd expect from 
Playboy-in-Disguise-senpai...

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:53.670
If ya call me that in front 
of the girls, I'll kill ya.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:57.180
Looks like their class isn't over yet.

00:08:57.440 --> 00:08:59.430
<i>Miyako, Miyako.</i>

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:09.440
That elementary school kid's really good!

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:12.600
I thought she skipped levels 
just because of her mom,

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:14.180
but it looks like that's not the case.

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:18.450
<i>No, it's not just that 
she's good... It's like...</i>

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:21.050
<i>I can't seem to look at anyone but Natsuki.</i>

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:26.090
That's one hell of a scary face
 she's makin', though.

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:28.260
Oh, she's gettin' a correction.

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:33.470
Oh, they're done. Let's go.

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:54.690
Can I ask Miyako-chan for her LIME?

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:58.360
I'd like to become special friends with her.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.000
Playboy-in-Disguise-senpai...

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:04.770
I'm not thinkin' about that stuff yet.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:07.230
I was just hopin' we could 
go on a date or somethin'.

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:08.830
Impossible.

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:12.180
Miyako likes <i>me</i>.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.870
Oh? I see...

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:17.160
Misaki!

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:19.870
The girls from the SS class...

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:21.580
are here!

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:23.350
Luou!

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:25.310
Huh?

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:27.270
Where's Jumpei?

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:36.530
Oh, wow...

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:39.740
Delete that!

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:44.890
If a video of me in a leotard 
gets online, I could be expelled!

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:46.810
I won't post it anywhere.

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:51.170
Were you recording me because 
I had a weird expression on my face?

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:51.890
Huh?

00:10:51.890 --> 00:10:53.370
You make me so mad!

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:57.320
I know! The teacher always tells me that.

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:59.620
She says, "It's good to be 
serious about dancing,

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:01.970
but don't take yourself too seriously."

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:05.230
Good one.

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:09.620
But that expression you have with 
your teeth clenched is stunning.

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:11.000
It's so emo.

00:11:11.550 --> 00:11:14.430
"E-Ero"?! What?!

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:16.170
Pervert! Get outta here!

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:18.420
No, I said <i>"emo"</i>!

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.570
You're still practicing?

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:22.990
Do you always stay late?

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:27.090
How can everyone smile like that?

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:28.860
And just go home?

00:11:28.860 --> 00:11:31.790
I can't stand it if I'm not the best.

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.080
It makes me want to die.

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:39.100
If I can do something about it 
by working hard, then it's simple.

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:41.040
I'll work as hard as I need to.

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:46.800
Guess you can't take a joke, little lady!

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:47.890
I'll erase it, okay?

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:49.710
See you tomorrow!

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:55.260
<i>In the depths... of her eyes...</i>

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:58.400
<i>are small flames...</i>

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:01.030
<i>Young and innocent...</i>

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:04.190
<i>Single-minded...</i>

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:09.680
<i>She really was stunning...</i>

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:13.010
<i>Anyway,</i>

00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:16.090
<i>that Natsuki is impossible.</i>

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:22.090
<b>Fifth Day of Summer School</b>

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:24.340
So anyway, I won't get in your way.

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:27.880
I'll match you and catch 
you 100% of the time!

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.100
Not bad.

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:37.360
Okay, practice the preparation 
for a pirouette next.

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:40.620
All right, let's do it!

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:42.790
It's kinda fun when we're in sync, huh?

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:46.000
It's more fun for me to dance by myself.

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:47.370
I'm done with this.

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:49.470
What the heck?!

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:51.610
I've been matching you 
with everything I've got!

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:56.130
Just so you know, I only clapped 
for you at the pirouette match

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:58.880
because you were better than the big guy.

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:00.650
Even if what you did was crazy,

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:04.170
you were more interesting 
as the prince in <i>Swan Lake</i>!

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:07.890
Why are you playing it so safe now?

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:11.610
"Safe"...

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:15.320
That's not it...

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:19.270
I thought it'd be better if 
I danced with precision.

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:22.440
And now, dancing in that crazy way...

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:25.280
feels embarrassing...

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:30.340
You're like a monkey with
 human intelligence!

00:13:31.170 --> 00:13:32.730
You little—

00:13:32.730 --> 00:13:34.690
If I could dance properly,

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:39.210
I'd wanna dance with a "bang" like that 
<i>Flames of Paris</i> video I saw yesterday!

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:41.530
Wait, wait, I've seen that video!

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:42.060
Huh?!

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:44.020
It's really amazing, right?

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:46.760
Each dancer was really good on their own...

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:51.260
And then they came together to give an 
amazing performance in perfect harmony!

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:53.070
It was the opposite of "safe"!

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:54.030
Yeah, yeah!

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:55.850
Like they're smugly saying, "Hah! Hah!"

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:57.570
While showing respect for each other!

00:13:57.570 --> 00:13:58.520
And on top of that...

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:00.610
They're having so much fun!

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:07.510
Sauté arabesque, sauté passé,

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:10.160
glissade, grande jeté!

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:11.910
Natsuki, turn there!

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:14.690
Sauté 'besque, chassé, 'sé, 'sé, 'sé!

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:15.910
What the heck?

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:18.420
Jump!

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:21.250
You've got a good memory,

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:23.890
but it's really hard to
match jumps, you know.

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:26.830
Your jumps are really high,

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:29.740
and if I use all my strength to
 jump, it'll mess up my rhythm—

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:31.470
Oh, so you're too chicken to try?

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:35.720
I thought you'd die if you weren't the best?

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:38.600
It's just copying them for a few seconds.

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:42.730
Huh? What are those two doin'?

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:48.740
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:54.310
<i>Wait, what </i>is<i> this?</i>

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:04.270
<i>Hey, let's do that again!</i>

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:07.260
<i>No, I wanna go all the way out!</i>

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:08.540
<i>Natsuki!</i>

00:15:09.060 --> 00:15:10.260
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:22.850
They're gonna crash!

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:28.530
Hey!

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:30.270
Stop playing around!

00:15:30.270 --> 00:15:33.120
At least gauge your distance properly!

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:40.010
I... didn't think we'd jump this far...

00:15:40.010 --> 00:15:43.790
Okay, it's time to end 
the pas de deux lesson.

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:46.800
Bow to your partners.

00:15:58.440 --> 00:15:59.980
Why...

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:05.060
Listen,

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:08.820
Boys' Changing Room

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:09.060
gettin' to know girls 
is good for your ballet.

00:16:09.060 --> 00:16:15.570
So, I've made arrangements to go out 
with the SS class girls after this.

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:17.080
We'll all go together!

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:19.700
Hey, where do ya think you're goin'?

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:24.460
As our token "dead-eyed pretty boy," 
 your attendance is mandatory.

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:25.930
"Dead-eyed"!

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:29.850
Just stay a bit. Then you can 
go home with Miyako-chan.

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:33.840
Girls love boys with dead eyes.

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:33.840
<i>It doesn't look like Natsuki will be there.</i>

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:35.080
What, really?!

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:36.360
<i>That was crazy...</i>

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:38.980
<i>What </i>was<i> that, anyway?</i>

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:44.350
<i>I can't believe I could be so in sync 
with someone else in both body and spirit!</i>

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:48.830
<i>Just remembering it gives me chills.</i>

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:51.360
<i>Oh, I wanna do it again!</i>

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:53.950
<i>I bet she's still practicing.</i>

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.690
Hey, where are ya goin'?

00:16:55.690 --> 00:16:57.530
I'll catch up later!

00:16:59.860 --> 00:17:01.240
Jumpei!

00:17:01.760 --> 00:17:04.270
Miyako-chan's waitin' for ya in the salon.

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:05.750
Said she wants to talk to ya.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:08.450
You dog. She's definitely 
gonna confess her feelings.

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:09.610
Huh?!

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:10.500
What?!

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:15.180
Jumpei-kun, here's some advice 
from your "In-Disguise" senpai.

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:20.200
Girls like that, who aren't really 
aware of how cute they are,

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:22.590
just need a little push.

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:26.900
<i>Easy for him to say...</i>

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:28.700
<i>But I'm not expecting anything!</i>

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:31.600
<i>How many times have I choked back tears?!</i>

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:32.710
Jumpei.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:39.310
<i>She's so freakin' cute.</i>

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:42.470
Wow, you're reading about ballet!

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:44.160
<i>Huh?</i>

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:46.410
<i>Her lips...</i>

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:47.940
<i>They're shiny...</i>

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:51.310
Jumpei, what did you want to tell me?

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:55.710
Huh? Misaki-kun said <i>you</i> 
had something to tell <i>me</i>.

00:17:55.710 --> 00:18:00.840
Huh? Misaki-kun's partner said 
<i>you</i> wanted to talk to <i>me.</i>..

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:01.680
Huh?

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:04.930
Jeez, what're they doing?

00:18:08.050 --> 00:18:10.530
Well? Where's Miyako?

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:13.530
Probably meeting up with 
Jumpei-kun in the salon.

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:15.550
I hope things work out with them.

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:18.300
That girl's so clueless sometimes.

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:22.660
Luou, that's not how you get to the salon.

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:27.160
I forgot something, too. 
Wanna go back together?

00:18:29.860 --> 00:18:33.390
Oh, your pas de deux with
 Natsuki-chan was amazing!

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:39.050
You were both so good, like two
 prodigies dancing together!

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:42.830
You can't dance like that with me, can you?

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:44.810
Huh? What are you saying?

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:46.470
You're also...

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:49.070
<i>...in perfect sync with Luou...</i>

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:52.320
...in the SS class. It's amazing!

00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:54.830
Yeah, for some reason.

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:58.070
But y'know, Natsuki-chan is the best by far.

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:02.820
I feel like I'm always competing 
for second with the rest of the girls.

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:07.580
Do you know why I also 
take lessons at Oikawa?

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:09.040
It's because of what Mom said.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.530
You don't have enough charisma.

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:13.860
Even if you keep at ballet,
 you won't make prima ballerina.

00:19:14.180 --> 00:19:17.340
But for some reason, 
Ayako-san thinks highly of you.

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:20.580
She said that if I wanted to 
keep being involved with ballet,

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:22.130
then I should join Oikawa

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:25.910
and work hard to get in the corps 
de ballet or get small parts.

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:28.470
I dreamed of being prima 
ballerina just a little, though.

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:31.180
<i>That's so mean, Chizuru-san!</i>

00:19:31.180 --> 00:19:36.100
But that means if I work hard, 
there's a chance I could stand on stage.

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:37.440
Wait a minute, Miyako.

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:39.610
That's... I...

00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:43.420
like you!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:53.120
Oh, you mean my dancing, right?

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:56.380
I know! I know that!

00:19:57.720 --> 00:19:59.690
Oh, jeez...

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:06.660
Let's go join the others.

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:10.680
<i>She smells good...</i>

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:16.110
<i>She smells good...</i>

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:24.950
H-Huh?! Wait—

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:28.330
S-Sorry...

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:33.240
Jumpei...

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.340
Let's go join the others...

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:40.340
I'm really sorry.

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:41.560
I like you!

00:20:48.530 --> 00:20:52.990
So... it's not that I didn't want it...

00:20:52.990 --> 00:20:54.140
It was just out of order!

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:58.770
I-I-It's just that we should, y'know, 
see how the other person feels first...

00:21:00.220 --> 00:21:05.070
And anyway, in a place like this, 
where anyone could walk by...

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:06.150
You know?

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:11.820
Miyako, I like you.

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:28.460
That's not hidin' a thing.

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:32.890
Hey, Luou, those two were datin', huh?

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:35.390
You didn't hear about it?

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:38.860
Oh, you headin' home?

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:43.650
You shouldn't get in their way from now on.

00:21:46.190 --> 00:21:49.290
Maybe we don't have to join the others.

00:21:49.290 --> 00:21:52.490
But Luou might not be able 
to go home by himself.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:55.600
Shouldn't he be able to by now?

00:21:55.600 --> 00:21:58.510
Anyway, what country did 
he live in before this?

00:21:58.510 --> 00:22:01.060
Huh? He was born in America,

00:22:01.060 --> 00:22:03.630
but he's been living in Japan 
since he was almost four.

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:10.230
He stayed at home with our grandma 
and never went to school,

00:22:10.230 --> 00:22:12.390
so he's a little ignorant about the world.

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.250
<i>"A little"?</i>

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:17.770
Your grandma taught Luou ballet, right?

00:22:18.370 --> 00:22:20.010
Where is she now?

00:22:22.100 --> 00:22:24.780
She has dementia, so she lives in a home...

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:28.920
And that's why Luou lives with us now.

00:22:32.140 --> 00:22:36.890
His mom doesn't come see him 
or wanna take him back?

00:22:36.890 --> 00:22:38.850
No, it doesn't look like it.

00:22:38.850 --> 00:22:43.170
I don't think he's seen Mazuru-san 
since coming back to Japan.

00:22:44.850 --> 00:22:48.860
He's lucky to have relatives 
like you and Chizuru-san.

00:22:53.160 --> 00:22:54.310
Huh?

00:22:54.310 --> 00:22:56.560
Nothing happened.

00:22:57.170 --> 00:22:58.180
Well?

00:22:59.470 --> 00:23:01.970
It was just as you said, 
Shameless-Playboy-senpai.

00:23:01.970 --> 00:23:04.070
She just needed a little push.

00:23:05.070 --> 00:23:07.910
I didn't think you'd push that far, though.

00:23:07.910 --> 00:23:09.320
H-Huh?!

00:23:10.150 --> 00:23:11.700
You two are cute together.

00:23:12.290 --> 00:23:14.450
Be good to her.

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:20.960
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:21.310 --> 00:23:23.600
I've always wanted to do it.

00:23:24.230 --> 00:23:27.840
What's wrong with dancing 
my own way in secret?

00:23:28.460 --> 00:23:33.570
<i>Dance Dance Danseur</i>, Act 9: 
"I Wanna Get Better, Too!"

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:34.890
Act 9
"I Wanna Get Better, Too!"
